00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:14,740
(Watch on KonFlix.vip)

1
00:00:01,106 --> 00:00:03,442
[♪ pop music playing]

2
00:00:45,359 --> 00:00:49,071
PERFECT CROWN

3
00:00:59,956 --> 00:01:01,083
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION

4
00:01:01,166 --> 00:01:03,085
CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
WERE FILMED SAFELY

5
00:01:04,044 --> 00:01:05,045
Tell me.

6
00:01:05,671 --> 00:01:07,339
Who are you trying to save here? Yourself?

7
00:01:07,422 --> 00:01:08,507
Or the Grand Prince?

8
00:01:11,259 --> 00:01:12,260
Him.

9
00:01:13,136 --> 00:01:14,221
[♪ tender music plays]

10
00:01:14,304 --> 00:01:16,181
I can save myself.

11
00:01:17,474 --> 00:01:18,475
You…

12
00:01:19,476 --> 00:01:20,769
Please, Father.

13
00:01:25,982 --> 00:01:27,109
[sighs]

14
00:01:32,864 --> 00:01:34,157
Divorce him.

15
00:01:36,535 --> 00:01:39,538
You bear the brunt of the allegations,
from ambitions for the throne

16
00:01:39,621 --> 00:01:41,665
to the staged marriage,

17
00:01:42,290 --> 00:01:43,458
and divorce him.

18
00:01:45,836 --> 00:01:46,837
Father…

19
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,755
When he loses you, his weakness,

20
00:01:48,839 --> 00:01:51,007
the opposition will
have nothing left to target.

21
00:01:51,091 --> 00:01:52,092
Then the Grand Prince

22
00:01:53,176 --> 00:01:55,554
will be able to fight back
without restraint.

23
00:02:08,066 --> 00:02:09,067
[sniffles]

24
00:02:09,151 --> 00:02:10,152
What if…

25
00:02:13,113 --> 00:02:14,990
What if I want to save myself?

26
00:02:15,490 --> 00:02:17,117
You said to choose between us.

27
00:02:19,161 --> 00:02:20,287
That path, too,

28
00:02:21,413 --> 00:02:22,414
leads to divorce.

29
00:02:28,086 --> 00:02:30,046
Get out of that hellhole.

30
00:02:31,339 --> 00:02:32,799
Avoid getting hurt any further.

31
00:02:44,811 --> 00:02:45,896
[cries]

32
00:03:03,789 --> 00:03:07,709
PERFECT CROWN

33
00:03:08,251 --> 00:03:09,920
EPISODE 10

34
00:03:14,549 --> 00:03:17,010
His Royal Highness is inside.

35
00:03:22,057 --> 00:03:23,517
[breathes shakily]

36
00:03:27,646 --> 00:03:29,439
-[door opens]
-[footsteps approaching]

37
00:03:41,993 --> 00:03:42,994
Your Royal Highness.

38
00:03:46,414 --> 00:03:47,457
[chuckles]

39
00:03:51,920 --> 00:03:53,338
How's your father doing?

40
00:03:59,678 --> 00:04:03,014
[chuckles] What's this? A gift?

41
00:04:06,476 --> 00:04:07,644
[inhales sharply]

42
00:04:07,727 --> 00:04:09,437
[sighs] Your Royal Highness.

43
00:04:11,356 --> 00:04:12,440
Yes?

44
00:04:23,577 --> 00:04:24,744
Let's get a divorce.
STYLE
::cue()

45
00:04:35,422 --> 00:04:39,134
[sad music playing]

46
00:04:48,643 --> 00:04:49,728
What are you talking about?

47
00:04:50,770 --> 00:04:51,771
I think it's time…

48
00:04:56,610 --> 00:04:57,694
we go our separate ways.

49
00:05:12,459 --> 00:05:13,710
[sighs]

50
00:05:17,547 --> 00:05:19,215
Father has fallen ill from all the stress.

51
00:05:21,301 --> 00:05:24,262
The stocks are tanking,
and public sentiment is in the mud.

52
00:05:28,934 --> 00:05:30,685
I heard there's a tax audit coming soon.

53
00:05:31,645 --> 00:05:33,229
No wonder he's fallen ill.

54
00:05:38,526 --> 00:05:40,737
I got married to become the successor.

55
00:05:42,489 --> 00:05:43,490
But at this rate,

56
00:05:45,116 --> 00:05:46,952
I won't even have a place to go back to.

57
00:05:53,375 --> 00:05:54,834
I hear what you're saying, but…

58
00:05:54,918 --> 00:05:55,961
It's not your fault.

59
00:05:58,004 --> 00:05:59,464
We were both in the wrong.

60
00:06:07,430 --> 00:06:08,431
But now,

61
00:06:10,517 --> 00:06:12,102
I want to cut my losses.

62
00:06:19,150 --> 00:06:20,360
That's why you want a divorce?

63
00:06:21,695 --> 00:06:23,029
To cut your losses?

64
00:06:23,113 --> 00:06:26,491
The quickest fix for stuff like this
is someone stepping up to take the fall.

65
00:06:28,368 --> 00:06:30,036
Holding out isn't always the answer.

66
00:06:36,334 --> 00:06:37,877
Did something happen while I was gone?

67
00:06:38,670 --> 00:06:39,671
Did the Queen Mother--

68
00:06:39,754 --> 00:06:43,133
Whatever the Queen Mother says to me
is none of your concern.

69
00:06:45,218 --> 00:06:46,928
-Seong Huiju.
-I already told you.

70
00:06:47,012 --> 00:06:48,221
[♪ sad music continues]

71
00:06:48,304 --> 00:06:50,640
I'm not afraid of that
because I had no honor to begin with.

72
00:06:52,183 --> 00:06:54,060
Royal dignity, propriety, or whatever.

73
00:06:55,311 --> 00:06:57,188
I couldn't care less
about any of that crap.

74
00:06:59,065 --> 00:07:00,817
Does it even exist?

75
00:07:01,943 --> 00:07:03,903
-Seong Huiju!
-Everything I have

76
00:07:05,613 --> 00:07:07,198
actually has substance.

77
00:07:08,241 --> 00:07:10,201
They're things I've fought for…

78
00:07:11,411 --> 00:07:13,121
and claimed with my own hands.

79
00:07:19,878 --> 00:07:21,838
You said the duty
of a royal is to be loved.

80
00:07:23,173 --> 00:07:24,466
You said that was power.

81
00:07:27,761 --> 00:07:29,179
But you lost it all.

82
00:07:31,890 --> 00:07:33,558
What could you possibly do for me now?

83
00:07:46,404 --> 00:07:47,405
Don't do this.

84
00:07:57,290 --> 00:07:59,292
Not you too…

85
00:07:59,375 --> 00:08:00,877
You said you wouldn't hold me back.

86
00:08:03,838 --> 00:08:05,507
You told me to just keep taking.

87
00:08:08,510 --> 00:08:10,303
But I'm just losing everything right now.

88
00:08:13,473 --> 00:08:14,474
And yet…

89
00:08:16,935 --> 00:08:18,394
you wish to keep me bound to you?

90
00:09:00,270 --> 00:09:03,273
[♪ music ends]
STYLE
::cue()

91
00:09:22,208 --> 00:09:23,209
Your Royal Highness.

92
00:09:23,293 --> 00:09:26,045
This is the Crown Prince's Quarters.

93
00:09:28,923 --> 00:09:30,425
It is a hall without a master.

94
00:09:31,259 --> 00:09:32,260
Your Royal Highness.

95
00:09:32,343 --> 00:09:33,636
I wish to be alone.

96
00:09:35,263 --> 00:09:36,681
Go back to Anhwadang Hall.

97
00:10:04,209 --> 00:10:06,586
[♪ gentle music plays]

98
00:10:24,270 --> 00:10:25,688
[exhales shakily]

99
00:11:04,477 --> 00:11:05,728
[cries]

100
00:11:47,562 --> 00:11:48,563
[I-AN] Brother.

101
00:11:50,148 --> 00:11:51,607
Look after the Crown Princess.

102
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:55,945
You are all she has to rely on.

103
00:11:57,071 --> 00:11:58,614
Must you make things hard for her?

104
00:11:58,698 --> 00:11:59,699
[scoffs]

105
00:12:01,284 --> 00:12:02,827
She relies on me?

106
00:12:06,205 --> 00:12:07,957
[sighs] Brother.

107
00:12:08,041 --> 00:12:11,252
I doubt she ever relied on me.

108
00:12:12,295 --> 00:12:13,546
But even if she did,

109
00:12:14,881 --> 00:12:17,258
what could I possibly do for her?

110
00:12:22,847 --> 00:12:24,432
I am sure she is well aware.

111
00:12:26,726 --> 00:12:27,935
Such is the nature

112
00:12:29,145 --> 00:12:30,355
of my station.

113
00:12:30,438 --> 00:12:32,398
[♪ gentle music plays]

114
00:12:32,482 --> 00:12:35,151
And the same must be said
for the Crown Princess.

115
00:12:41,074 --> 00:12:42,825
You are just being a coward.

116
00:12:49,665 --> 00:12:50,666
Sure.

117
00:12:54,379 --> 00:12:55,755
I hope you do not end up like me.

118
00:13:00,051 --> 00:13:01,052
No.

119
00:13:02,011 --> 00:13:03,096
I don't intend to.

120
00:13:17,985 --> 00:13:19,278
Is this how it felt?

121
00:13:20,279 --> 00:13:22,657
[♪ music continues]
STYLE
::cue()

122
00:14:12,957 --> 00:14:14,458
Did you work through the night?

123
00:14:23,426 --> 00:14:24,427
Yeah.

124
00:14:34,437 --> 00:14:35,438
What is it?

125
00:14:36,147 --> 00:14:37,148
What?

126
00:14:37,732 --> 00:14:38,983
Say what you need to say.

127
00:14:45,156 --> 00:14:47,033
Please let me get into the Council Hall.

128
00:14:50,119 --> 00:14:51,913
We need their approval for a divorce.

129
00:14:53,789 --> 00:14:55,124
I'd like to speak for myself.

130
00:15:03,424 --> 00:15:04,425
Do so, then.

131
00:15:14,477 --> 00:15:15,478
Aide Choi.

132
00:15:16,979 --> 00:15:18,606
Are they really going to get divorced?

133
00:15:19,607 --> 00:15:21,651
[stammers] Well, what can we do?

134
00:15:21,734 --> 00:15:23,569
The party involved is intent on it.

135
00:15:23,653 --> 00:15:25,738
And the Grand Prince doesn't get a say?

136
00:15:26,322 --> 00:15:29,659
Well, His Royal Highness agreed to it…

137
00:15:29,742 --> 00:15:32,536
No, but you know he doesn't mean it!

138
00:15:32,620 --> 00:15:34,330
What sort of nonsense is that?

139
00:15:37,541 --> 00:15:38,751
Something happened yesterday.

140
00:15:41,921 --> 00:15:43,089
Is the chairman making her?

141
00:15:47,385 --> 00:15:49,595
Your Royal Highness.
By chance, did the chairman--

142
00:15:49,679 --> 00:15:50,680
I'm getting a divorce.

143
00:15:51,347 --> 00:15:52,348
Pardon?

144
00:15:52,431 --> 00:15:53,557
The whole world

145
00:15:54,850 --> 00:15:57,019
refers to me as a stain on his reputation.

146
00:15:58,479 --> 00:16:01,148
-Your Royal Highness, that's just--
-Stain or weakness…

147
00:16:02,817 --> 00:16:04,860
They should be eliminated regardless.

148
00:16:09,740 --> 00:16:11,409
If His Royal Highness refuses…

149
00:16:15,913 --> 00:16:17,123
I need you to take my side.

150
00:16:20,459 --> 00:16:22,253
The chairman is just a bit frustrated.

151
00:16:22,336 --> 00:16:25,423
He didn't put her up to anything.
[chuckles]

152
00:16:25,506 --> 00:16:27,883
Then why? Why, all of a sudden?

153
00:16:27,967 --> 00:16:30,469
[phone buzzing]

154
00:16:32,596 --> 00:16:33,931
Don't go anywhere. Wait here.

155
00:16:37,268 --> 00:16:38,602
Yes, Your Royal Highness.

156
00:16:40,313 --> 00:16:41,772
[sighs]

157
00:16:49,071 --> 00:16:50,531
I understand, Your Royal Highness.

158
00:16:53,659 --> 00:16:55,536
[♪ tense music playing]

159
00:17:03,919 --> 00:17:05,421
[court staff]
Announcing Grand Prince I-AN.
STYLE
::cue()

160
00:17:18,100 --> 00:17:19,810
LORD INPYEONG

161
00:17:19,894 --> 00:17:20,895
Two days ago,

162
00:17:22,188 --> 00:17:23,272
the Cabinet requested

163
00:17:23,356 --> 00:17:26,817
that His Royal Highness
cease his official duties…

164
00:17:31,072 --> 00:17:32,365
His Royal Highness and I…

165
00:17:34,575 --> 00:17:35,868
will be getting a divorce.

166
00:17:36,911 --> 00:17:38,079
[staff chattering]

167
00:17:38,162 --> 00:17:40,039
-What is this now?
-All of a sudden?

168
00:17:40,122 --> 00:17:41,123
Grand Princess!

169
00:17:42,458 --> 00:17:43,751
Strip me of my rank.

170
00:17:45,628 --> 00:17:48,005
I risked it all to gain royal status,

171
00:17:48,089 --> 00:17:50,257
was a prime suspect
in the Junghwajeon Hall fire,

172
00:17:50,966 --> 00:17:52,927
and collapsed after being poisoned.

173
00:17:53,427 --> 00:17:54,762
[scoffs]

174
00:17:54,845 --> 00:17:55,971
That was all me.

175
00:17:56,472 --> 00:17:57,473
Grand Princess.

176
00:17:57,556 --> 00:17:59,767
My point is, do not pin this
on the wrong person.

177
00:18:01,185 --> 00:18:05,106
It appears you do not grasp
the gravity of this situation.

178
00:18:05,189 --> 00:18:06,190
[Huiju] Prime Minister Min.

179
00:18:08,943 --> 00:18:11,654
I was told the royal family
are not subject to investigation.

180
00:18:12,905 --> 00:18:15,449
Without the king's approval,
it is difficult, but…

181
00:18:15,533 --> 00:18:16,826
If I am stripped of my rank,

182
00:18:17,618 --> 00:18:19,453
it should be easier to investigate me, no?

183
00:18:24,208 --> 00:18:26,419
Approve our divorce

184
00:18:28,212 --> 00:18:29,588
and investigate me.

185
00:18:29,672 --> 00:18:32,007
[♪ dramatic music plays]

186
00:18:32,091 --> 00:18:33,092
Seong Huiju.

187
00:18:33,801 --> 00:18:36,303
Whether I'm the culprit behind the fire,

188
00:18:36,387 --> 00:18:39,140
or I staged my own collapse.

189
00:18:39,223 --> 00:18:43,227
Either way, I can prove that
the Grand Prince had no part in any of it.

190
00:18:45,813 --> 00:18:46,814
So just do it.

191
00:18:47,732 --> 00:18:50,735
And all this insolent talk of him
relinquishing the regency…

192
00:18:52,445 --> 00:18:53,571
Enough of that.

193
00:19:06,167 --> 00:19:08,085
[reporters chattering]

194
00:19:09,128 --> 00:19:10,379
[Taeju] Why are there so many?

195
00:19:10,963 --> 00:19:12,506
Babe, you got this, right?

196
00:19:13,007 --> 00:19:14,717
A walk in the park. [sniffles]

197
00:19:15,718 --> 00:19:17,219
Why couldn't she just do it herself?

198
00:19:17,303 --> 00:19:19,388
Huiju is the Grand Princess now.
How could she?

199
00:19:19,472 --> 00:19:21,432
Besides, the camera loves you more.

200
00:19:22,600 --> 00:19:24,226
That's true. [clears throat]

201
00:19:24,935 --> 00:19:25,936
Let's go.

202
00:19:26,854 --> 00:19:27,855
[clears throat]

203
00:19:29,273 --> 00:19:30,483
[reporter] There's CEO Seong Taeju!

204
00:19:30,566 --> 00:19:31,650
[reporters clamoring]

205
00:19:31,734 --> 00:19:33,194
-CEO Seong!
-CEO Seong!

206
00:19:33,277 --> 00:19:34,361
[shutters clicking]

207
00:19:34,445 --> 00:19:36,071
-Please look over here.
-CEO Seong!

208
00:19:36,155 --> 00:19:38,991
-CEO Seong!
-Over here, sir!

209
00:19:39,074 --> 00:19:41,118
-Over here, please!
-CEO Seong!

210
00:19:41,202 --> 00:19:44,747
ADDRESSING THE MARRIAGE CONTRACT LEAK

211
00:19:46,373 --> 00:19:47,625
[clears throat]

212
00:19:49,835 --> 00:19:50,836
Oh, right.

213
00:19:55,549 --> 00:19:57,968
Can you confirm that Castle Group
had no knowledge

214
00:19:58,052 --> 00:20:00,721
of the marriage contract
between the Grand Prince and Princess?

215
00:20:00,805 --> 00:20:04,183
There must be some sort of plan
behind the three-year-divorce promise…

216
00:20:04,266 --> 00:20:06,644
Following the marriage, has the handover
of her management rights

217
00:20:06,727 --> 00:20:08,813
-been properly finalized?
-Just a moment.

218
00:20:08,896 --> 00:20:10,940
First, let's calm down.

219
00:20:11,023 --> 00:20:14,151
There are allegations that she staged
her collapse. Is that true?

220
00:20:14,235 --> 00:20:15,694
[shutters continue clicking]

221
00:20:15,778 --> 00:20:17,571
-What?
-To hide the fact it was staged,

222
00:20:17,655 --> 00:20:20,324
she was taken to Castle Hospital
and not Royal Seoul Hospital.

223
00:20:20,407 --> 00:20:22,368
-Is that true?
-[scoffs]

224
00:20:23,911 --> 00:20:25,955
They're even calling that a lie now?

225
00:20:27,039 --> 00:20:28,040
[clears throat]

226
00:20:30,125 --> 00:20:32,378
[reporters clamoring]

227
00:20:34,922 --> 00:20:35,923
Ma'am.

228
00:20:36,966 --> 00:20:39,510
Why would she take poison
when she had the world at her feet?

229
00:20:40,386 --> 00:20:42,054
[reporters clamor]

230
00:20:42,137 --> 00:20:44,682
[♪ dramatic music playing]
STYLE
::cue()

231
00:20:48,394 --> 00:20:49,895
We just got started here.

232
00:20:49,979 --> 00:20:51,939
AIDE CHOI HYEON

233
00:20:56,902 --> 00:20:58,654
Regarding the contract,

234
00:20:58,737 --> 00:21:01,991
Castle Group will be
watering things down on our end.

235
00:21:02,074 --> 00:21:03,826
So I'd appreciate your patience.

236
00:21:03,909 --> 00:21:06,495
It won't be a perfectly clean slate,

237
00:21:07,079 --> 00:21:09,123
but it'll lose enough steam
to make it manageable.

238
00:21:09,206 --> 00:21:11,834
Do you truly believe
it is that simple a matter?

239
00:21:11,917 --> 00:21:14,169
I'm sure you all know how much money

240
00:21:15,671 --> 00:21:16,839
was poured into our wedding.

241
00:21:17,756 --> 00:21:20,968
And that more was made
than was ever spent.

242
00:21:23,262 --> 00:21:24,638
It's surely not news to you.

243
00:21:26,390 --> 00:21:28,893
Before all contributors start asking
for their money back,

244
00:21:29,768 --> 00:21:32,479
shouldn't we at least deny the fact
that this marriage

245
00:21:33,230 --> 00:21:34,732
was a sham?

246
00:21:35,983 --> 00:21:37,067
[Taeju] For starters,

247
00:21:37,151 --> 00:21:40,321
I assume all of you have seen
this marriage contract.

248
00:21:41,113 --> 00:21:43,824
Does the Grand Prince benefit
at all from this contract?

249
00:21:43,908 --> 00:21:45,200
Same goes for my sister.

250
00:21:45,284 --> 00:21:48,037
It stipulates that she'll relinquish
all assets and real estate

251
00:21:48,120 --> 00:21:50,456
acquired with her royal title
upon divorce.

252
00:21:50,539 --> 00:21:51,916
Did you all miss that part?

253
00:21:51,999 --> 00:21:54,835
-But this was for status--
-Hold on. Let me just say one thing.

254
00:21:55,502 --> 00:21:58,255
Everyone here knows
the palace was dead set against them

255
00:21:58,339 --> 00:22:01,675
when the scandal
about them dating first broke.

256
00:22:01,759 --> 00:22:04,762
Even our family didn't believe
they would actually get married.

257
00:22:04,845 --> 00:22:08,140
We told her to stop wasting time
and just focus on her work.

258
00:22:08,223 --> 00:22:09,516
But what could we do?

259
00:22:09,600 --> 00:22:10,976
They were madly in love.

260
00:22:11,060 --> 00:22:13,312
[reporters chattering]

261
00:22:13,395 --> 00:22:15,522
[reporter 1]
Well, if they're so madly in love,

262
00:22:15,606 --> 00:22:17,816
why would they agree
to divorce within three years?

263
00:22:18,359 --> 00:22:19,360
Right.

264
00:22:20,152 --> 00:22:22,863
That is why I'm here today.

265
00:22:24,114 --> 00:22:25,491
That clause.

266
00:22:27,201 --> 00:22:29,161
It was per my request.

267
00:22:29,244 --> 00:22:32,039
[reporter 2] Does that mean you were
involved in drawing up the contract?

268
00:22:32,122 --> 00:22:33,749
[reporter 3]
Between the Crown and Castle Group?

269
00:22:33,832 --> 00:22:37,086
They may be madly in love now,
but feelings fade.

270
00:22:37,169 --> 00:22:39,672
I mean, she was even drugged
at her own wedding.

271
00:22:39,755 --> 00:22:41,674
-It could make her want a divorce.
-[reporters murmur]

272
00:22:41,757 --> 00:22:45,427
But since divorce is considered taboo
in the royal family,

273
00:22:45,511 --> 00:22:48,597
I suggested they at least
draw up a contract.

274
00:22:49,348 --> 00:22:50,683
But let's be real.

275
00:22:50,766 --> 00:22:53,143
This wasn't even notarized by a lawyer.

276
00:22:53,227 --> 00:22:56,021
I just went a little overboard
to protect my little sister.

277
00:22:57,064 --> 00:23:00,359
I sincerely apologize
for the distress caused to the public.

278
00:23:00,442 --> 00:23:01,652
That said…

279
00:23:03,320 --> 00:23:06,782
you all keep spinning these stories
about pulling stunts and plotting treason.

280
00:23:06,865 --> 00:23:08,450
All sorts of ridiculous nonsense…

281
00:23:10,244 --> 00:23:12,413
I'll be saving all your articles as PDFs.

282
00:23:12,496 --> 00:23:13,747
[reporters clamor]

283
00:23:13,831 --> 00:23:14,915
[clears throat]

284
00:23:18,293 --> 00:23:20,796
[reporters clamor]

285
00:23:21,422 --> 00:23:23,090
[♪ upbeat music plays]

286
00:23:23,173 --> 00:23:24,717
You were so awesome, babe!

287
00:23:25,926 --> 00:23:27,428
-Let's hurry home.
-Okay.

288
00:23:29,179 --> 00:23:30,973
…all your articles as PDFs.

289
00:23:31,056 --> 00:23:33,267
-You reviewed the draft for the PR team?
-Yes.

290
00:23:33,767 --> 00:23:37,146
"Doting siblings," check.
"True love," check.

291
00:23:37,229 --> 00:23:38,814
"Saving as PDFs," check.

292
00:23:39,565 --> 00:23:40,649
All done.

293
00:23:40,733 --> 00:23:42,026
Yes, I knew it!

294
00:23:42,109 --> 00:23:45,029
They couldn't even look at each other
during the wedding rites

295
00:23:45,112 --> 00:23:47,114
without blushing and getting all giddy.

296
00:23:47,197 --> 00:23:50,951
How could that not be true love?

297
00:23:53,662 --> 00:23:55,039
[sighs]
STYLE
::cue()

298
00:23:57,958 --> 00:23:59,043
[sighs]

299
00:24:00,544 --> 00:24:01,920
It should be over by now.

300
00:24:02,004 --> 00:24:04,757
Without even consulting
with the Royal Secretariat?

301
00:24:04,840 --> 00:24:08,802
We made it crystal clear that the Crown
has no ties to the contract.

302
00:24:09,386 --> 00:24:13,807
We also clarified that the Grand Prince
stood to gain nothing from our marriage.

303
00:24:14,391 --> 00:24:16,101
Any remaining controversy

304
00:24:16,769 --> 00:24:18,187
will be mine to handle.

305
00:24:19,938 --> 00:24:21,440
Once you cast me aside,

306
00:24:22,775 --> 00:24:24,401
the Grand Prince can return…

307
00:24:26,820 --> 00:24:28,489
to being the pride of the Crown.

308
00:24:29,323 --> 00:24:30,407
[chuckles]

309
00:24:31,033 --> 00:24:32,826
[officials murmuring]

310
00:24:34,369 --> 00:24:35,621
Does His Royal Highness…

311
00:24:36,747 --> 00:24:38,457
share this sentiment?

312
00:24:42,795 --> 00:24:44,546
[♪ suspenseful music plays]

313
00:25:15,410 --> 00:25:16,954
Grand Prince I-AN

314
00:25:17,037 --> 00:25:18,956
shall receive His Majesty's command.

315
00:25:26,547 --> 00:25:27,881
[♪ music ends]

316
00:25:30,926 --> 00:25:33,762
[♪ gentle music plays]

317
00:25:56,869 --> 00:25:58,203
Is this how it felt?

318
00:26:10,424 --> 00:26:13,677
[♪ classical music plays]

319
00:26:22,269 --> 00:26:23,270
Even so…

320
00:26:29,568 --> 00:26:31,278
I refuse to live like you.

321
00:26:31,361 --> 00:26:33,405
[♪ dramatic music plays]

322
00:27:11,485 --> 00:27:12,736
Your Royal Highness.

323
00:27:12,819 --> 00:27:15,489
His Majesty has just retired
to his bedchamber.

324
00:27:15,572 --> 00:27:17,032
-Perhaps you can--
-Announce me.

325
00:27:18,325 --> 00:27:19,493
Your Royal Highness.

326
00:27:21,453 --> 00:27:22,621
I told you to announce me.

327
00:27:25,916 --> 00:27:27,084
Your Majesty,

328
00:27:27,167 --> 00:27:29,086
His Royal Highness has arrived.

329
00:27:31,213 --> 00:27:32,422
[King] Show him in.

330
00:27:32,923 --> 00:27:34,925
[♪ dramatic music continues]

331
00:27:54,403 --> 00:27:55,404
Your Majesty.

332
00:27:58,532 --> 00:27:59,658
I must ask you

333
00:28:01,410 --> 00:28:02,995
to return my throne.

334
00:28:09,501 --> 00:28:12,254
"Thus proclaims the King."

335
00:28:13,630 --> 00:28:15,257
-"I, the King…"
-[King Seonjong] I, the King,

336
00:28:15,340 --> 00:28:17,384
being overburdened in body and spirit,

337
00:28:17,467 --> 00:28:19,761
can no longer govern the realm.

338
00:28:21,680 --> 00:28:23,557
Thus, I intend to step down
from the throne.

339
00:28:26,018 --> 00:28:29,146
The Crown Prince is far too young

340
00:28:29,229 --> 00:28:30,897
and of a frail disposition

341
00:28:31,523 --> 00:28:33,191
to assume such a heavy responsibility.

342
00:28:34,234 --> 00:28:36,903
Fortunately, the heavens
have not forsaken us,

343
00:28:37,612 --> 00:28:39,156
and have bestowed upon us the wise
STYLE
::cue()

344
00:28:39,823 --> 00:28:41,241
and virtuous Grand Prince I-AN.

345
00:28:41,867 --> 00:28:42,951
"I deem him fit

346
00:28:43,452 --> 00:28:46,663
to serve the heavens
and the royal ancestors above,

347
00:28:46,747 --> 00:28:50,250
and to care for the people
of the realm below."

348
00:28:50,959 --> 00:28:52,753
As such, I, the King,

349
00:28:52,836 --> 00:28:55,172
intend to abdicate the throne
in favor of my uncle,

350
00:28:55,255 --> 00:28:57,049
Grand Prince I-AN.

351
00:28:58,633 --> 00:29:01,428
"All officials of the Crown
and the Cabinet

352
00:29:01,511 --> 00:29:04,473
shall receive and uphold
the new King with might."

353
00:29:06,433 --> 00:29:09,603
[King Seonjong] And all the people shall
embrace the grand vision of the nation…

354
00:29:09,686 --> 00:29:10,854
"THIRTY-SECOND KING"

355
00:29:10,937 --> 00:29:12,606
…so that the realm may stand firm,

356
00:29:13,398 --> 00:29:16,193
unshaken and everlasting.

357
00:29:21,865 --> 00:29:24,076
What is the meaning of this?

358
00:29:24,910 --> 00:29:26,536
A willful abdication?

359
00:29:26,620 --> 00:29:28,246
I must see His Majesty.

360
00:29:29,706 --> 00:29:30,707
Lord INPYEONG.

361
00:29:31,708 --> 00:29:33,168
Do you dismiss the royal command

362
00:29:35,754 --> 00:29:37,005
delivered by the Royal Secretariat?

363
00:29:39,508 --> 00:29:41,760
[♪ triumphant music plays]

364
00:29:59,653 --> 00:30:01,154
[♪ music ends]

365
00:30:01,238 --> 00:30:02,364
Your Royal Highness.

366
00:30:03,865 --> 00:30:05,200
Just hold on a second.

367
00:30:17,546 --> 00:30:19,005
You said you were done losing.

368
00:30:21,883 --> 00:30:23,218
That's why you want a divorce.

369
00:30:24,427 --> 00:30:25,428
[sighs]

370
00:30:26,096 --> 00:30:27,097
Your Royal Highness.

371
00:30:27,722 --> 00:30:29,349
-I just…
-And yet,

372
00:30:29,975 --> 00:30:31,852
how could you throw
everything on the line?

373
00:30:35,355 --> 00:30:36,398
Did you truly believe…

374
00:30:40,777 --> 00:30:41,778
I could not…

375
00:30:45,907 --> 00:30:46,950
protect us?

376
00:30:51,746 --> 00:30:52,747
It's not that…

377
00:30:52,831 --> 00:30:54,166
You did not trust me.

378
00:31:16,938 --> 00:31:18,273
Willful abdication?

379
00:31:18,356 --> 00:31:22,903
The royal edict was announced in front
of the Cabinet and the royal family.

380
00:31:24,738 --> 00:31:25,906
Why, all of a sudden?

381
00:31:28,450 --> 00:31:29,868
Without so much as a warning.

382
00:31:33,622 --> 00:31:35,790
-Tell me why!
-Please calm down, Your Majesty.

383
00:31:38,168 --> 00:31:40,921
Fortunately, His Royal Highness refused…

384
00:31:41,004 --> 00:31:42,839
That was just a formality!

385
00:31:44,049 --> 00:31:45,717
He will refuse three times…

386
00:31:47,969 --> 00:31:49,054
before he accepts.

387
00:31:52,432 --> 00:31:54,851
[scoffs, cries]

388
00:32:02,484 --> 00:32:04,861
That feeble bloodline has at last…

389
00:32:10,200 --> 00:32:11,243
[grunts]

390
00:32:14,120 --> 00:32:15,247
[straining]

391
00:32:16,373 --> 00:32:17,540
[sighs]

392
00:32:21,294 --> 00:32:22,295
Your Majesty.

393
00:32:22,379 --> 00:32:23,672
Open the doors.

394
00:32:23,755 --> 00:32:26,967
[court lady] His Majesty has locked them
from the inside.

395
00:32:27,050 --> 00:32:28,051
[Yun] Your Majesty!

396
00:32:29,803 --> 00:32:31,221
Open these doors!

397
00:32:32,097 --> 00:32:34,516
-Your Majesty!
-[court lady] Please stop, Your Majesty.

398
00:32:34,599 --> 00:32:36,518
[Yun] This is beyond the pale.

399
00:32:37,018 --> 00:32:38,019
Your Majesty!

400
00:32:39,980 --> 00:32:42,649
[Yun] Have you truly gone mad?

401
00:32:44,192 --> 00:32:45,568
I would rather see you dead.

402
00:32:49,406 --> 00:32:50,407
Your Majesty!

403
00:32:51,074 --> 00:32:53,451
Your Majesty,
please give His Majesty some time.

404
00:32:53,535 --> 00:32:55,203
What is this time you speak of?

405
00:32:56,204 --> 00:32:57,205
Your Majesty.

406
00:33:00,208 --> 00:33:01,876
You must have known.

407
00:33:03,169 --> 00:33:04,754
-Pardon?
-Court Lady Im.

408
00:33:04,838 --> 00:33:05,922
[Im] Yes, Your Majesty.

409
00:33:06,006 --> 00:33:07,882
[♪ tense music plays]

410
00:33:07,966 --> 00:33:09,217
Break down these doors.

411
00:33:09,843 --> 00:33:10,844
Your Majesty…

412
00:33:10,927 --> 00:33:12,387
These are the King's Quarters.

413
00:33:13,096 --> 00:33:15,390
How could I open them
without His Majesty's command?

414
00:33:18,393 --> 00:33:20,562
Please rescind your command.
STYLE
::cue()

415
00:33:22,939 --> 00:33:24,941
Start a fire if you must.

416
00:33:27,360 --> 00:33:28,903
That should force him out.

417
00:33:37,579 --> 00:33:38,580
[Jeongwoo] Your Majesty.

418
00:33:42,834 --> 00:33:44,377
Let me escort you to your quarters.

419
00:33:45,920 --> 00:33:47,422
Do not give me orders.

420
00:33:49,549 --> 00:33:50,550
I have yet…

421
00:33:52,260 --> 00:33:53,345
to give an order.

422
00:34:05,315 --> 00:34:06,524
[♪ music ends]

423
00:34:07,650 --> 00:34:09,527
We must allow no word of this to spread.

424
00:34:10,695 --> 00:34:12,489
I will handle the Cabinet members.

425
00:34:12,572 --> 00:34:14,991
You must see to it
that no word escapes the palace.

426
00:34:18,995 --> 00:34:21,247
Am I the only one
horrified by this situation?

427
00:34:22,290 --> 00:34:23,583
It is getting quite exhausting.

428
00:34:24,084 --> 00:34:27,045
How much longer must I keep cleaning up
the royal family's mess?

429
00:34:31,674 --> 00:34:33,301
This affects you as well.

430
00:34:37,430 --> 00:34:38,932
If Grand Prince I-AN becomes king,

431
00:34:39,015 --> 00:34:41,184
the Grand Princess will be bound
to the palace forever.

432
00:34:41,267 --> 00:34:42,352
Is that what you desire?

433
00:34:44,437 --> 00:34:45,730
That will not happen.

434
00:34:51,361 --> 00:34:53,780
The Grand Prince will refuse three times
as a formality.

435
00:34:53,863 --> 00:34:57,450
He refused once at the Council Hall today,
so he'll refuse two more times.

436
00:34:57,534 --> 00:34:58,535
Before he does,

437
00:34:59,828 --> 00:35:02,455
you must stop either
the Grand Prince or His Majesty.

438
00:35:04,833 --> 00:35:06,376
Do whatever you must.

439
00:35:12,841 --> 00:35:14,759
I shall put her poisoning case on hold.

440
00:35:15,510 --> 00:35:16,845
But you agreed to handle that--

441
00:35:16,928 --> 00:35:18,805
The handling of affairs you desire

442
00:35:18,888 --> 00:35:20,765
shall be granted to you

443
00:35:22,392 --> 00:35:23,518
once I get what I want.

444
00:35:29,023 --> 00:35:31,526
Are you threatening me right now?

445
00:35:32,318 --> 00:35:33,319
Yes.

446
00:35:34,904 --> 00:35:36,614
Is there any reason I should not?

447
00:35:57,051 --> 00:35:58,136
[sighs]

448
00:35:58,887 --> 00:36:00,346
You did not trust me.

449
00:36:02,891 --> 00:36:04,058
[sighs]

450
00:36:10,148 --> 00:36:11,441
[footsteps approaching]

451
00:36:14,027 --> 00:36:16,237
Why is it just you?
Where's the Grand Prince?

452
00:36:16,821 --> 00:36:17,906
He left.

453
00:36:17,989 --> 00:36:20,492
-He left? The palace?
-Yes.

454
00:36:21,534 --> 00:36:24,245
What is he thinking,
leaving at a time like this?

455
00:36:25,038 --> 00:36:26,831
He nearly died as just the Grand Prince.

456
00:36:26,915 --> 00:36:29,626
Who knows what'll happen
after this royal abdication edict?

457
00:36:29,709 --> 00:36:30,710
[dialing]

458
00:36:40,804 --> 00:36:41,805
[phone ringing]

459
00:36:41,888 --> 00:36:43,139
INCOMING CALL
JUNIOR ALUM

460
00:36:52,607 --> 00:36:54,234
[line ringing]

461
00:36:55,276 --> 00:36:56,444
[sighs]

462
00:36:56,945 --> 00:36:57,946
Stop it.

463
00:37:01,157 --> 00:37:02,867
How will you ever divorce him
at this rate?

464
00:37:10,124 --> 00:37:12,335
Aide Choi and I will find
the Grand Prince.

465
00:37:13,127 --> 00:37:14,420
You stay here.

466
00:37:14,504 --> 00:37:16,047
Can't have you missing each other.

467
00:37:30,228 --> 00:37:31,229
[sighs]

468
00:37:31,896 --> 00:37:33,815
[♪ gentle music plays]

469
00:37:35,733 --> 00:37:36,943
[sighs]

470
00:37:53,209 --> 00:37:55,003
If I say I wish to ascend the throne,

471
00:37:56,212 --> 00:37:57,964
all would condemn me and hurl insults.

472
00:38:01,801 --> 00:38:02,802
But I believe

473
00:38:03,928 --> 00:38:05,096
you would understand me.

474
00:38:05,179 --> 00:38:07,640
[♪ contemplative music playing]
STYLE
::cue()

475
00:38:09,976 --> 00:38:11,060
"Leading the way."

476
00:38:11,936 --> 00:38:12,937
How do you do it?

477
00:38:15,982 --> 00:38:17,525
You just need to walk by my side.

478
00:38:19,444 --> 00:38:20,570
I'll teach you.

479
00:38:22,822 --> 00:38:24,824
[♪ contemplative music continues]

480
00:38:37,962 --> 00:38:38,963
[exhales deeply]

481
00:38:39,047 --> 00:38:41,049
[♪ pop music playing, WOODZ "Everglow"]

482
00:38:50,642 --> 00:38:51,976
Just let me be for a second.

483
00:38:52,644 --> 00:38:54,771
I'll come back down
once my anger subsides a bit.

484
00:39:01,819 --> 00:39:03,029
[I-AN clears throat]

485
00:39:21,714 --> 00:39:22,715
[I-AN] I do like you.

486
00:39:24,342 --> 00:39:25,343
And it's my first time.

487
00:39:26,344 --> 00:39:27,679
You should just accept it all.

488
00:39:29,430 --> 00:39:31,057
Whether it be money, honor,

489
00:39:32,850 --> 00:39:33,851
or my heart…

490
00:39:41,150 --> 00:39:42,151
[sniffles]

491
00:39:47,240 --> 00:39:48,241
[sobs]

492
00:39:50,868 --> 00:39:51,869
[sobbing]

493
00:40:25,570 --> 00:40:26,946
[♪ music ends]

494
00:40:31,200 --> 00:40:33,119
Aide Do, here's what you asked for.

495
00:40:33,661 --> 00:40:35,538
-Let's go.
-Where?

496
00:40:35,621 --> 00:40:39,083
His Royal Highness left the palace
and won't take the Grand Princess's calls.

497
00:40:39,167 --> 00:40:41,294
What? What about the Royal Guard?

498
00:40:41,377 --> 00:40:43,671
No need to call them. I know where he is.

499
00:40:43,755 --> 00:40:45,715
[I-AN] After the royal abdication edict
is delivered,

500
00:40:45,798 --> 00:40:48,551
His Majesty will lock himself
in his quarters.

501
00:40:49,218 --> 00:40:51,345
I will leave and head to
my private residence.

502
00:40:52,013 --> 00:40:53,389
I must be gone

503
00:40:54,057 --> 00:40:56,100
so the Grand Princess
does not get embroiled in the chaos.

504
00:40:56,184 --> 00:40:57,185
[sighs]

505
00:40:57,810 --> 00:40:59,312
I understand, Your Royal Highness.

506
00:41:00,021 --> 00:41:02,273
Wow, so you knew all along?

507
00:41:02,356 --> 00:41:04,150
Then why didn't you loop me in?

508
00:41:05,068 --> 00:41:07,070
You didn't loop me in, either.

509
00:41:07,153 --> 00:41:08,571
About the Grand Princess's plan.

510
00:41:09,572 --> 00:41:10,782
Right. That's true.

511
00:41:12,450 --> 00:41:14,077
Wait, so where are we going?

512
00:41:14,160 --> 00:41:16,287
-To get a drink.
-[Hyeon] What?

513
00:41:22,001 --> 00:41:23,795
[breathing heavily]

514
00:41:24,587 --> 00:41:26,214
[Hyejeong] Everything's a mess anyway.

515
00:41:26,297 --> 00:41:29,050
Might as well have a drink
since it's not allowed in the palace.

516
00:41:29,133 --> 00:41:31,094
Well, th-that's true…

517
00:41:31,177 --> 00:41:33,179
[breathes deeply]

518
00:41:37,975 --> 00:41:38,976
[Hyejeong sighs]

519
00:41:41,229 --> 00:41:42,230
This is it.

520
00:41:42,939 --> 00:41:44,273
This is what I like.

521
00:41:46,734 --> 00:41:47,735
That's random.

522
00:41:51,572 --> 00:41:52,824
You asked what I liked.

523
00:41:54,367 --> 00:41:55,409
This is what I like.

524
00:41:56,577 --> 00:41:57,620
With the Hangang River here.

525
00:42:00,331 --> 00:42:01,332
[sighs]

526
00:42:01,415 --> 00:42:03,417
[♪ gentle music playing]

527
00:42:16,556 --> 00:42:17,557
[sighs]

528
00:42:21,018 --> 00:42:22,228
What do you think?

529
00:42:22,311 --> 00:42:23,312
[smacks lips]

530
00:42:23,396 --> 00:42:24,397
Well, it's…

531
00:42:25,815 --> 00:42:27,108
I-I like it.

532
00:42:30,319 --> 00:42:31,445
[chuckles softly]

533
00:42:32,572 --> 00:42:33,698
What exactly?

534
00:42:34,991 --> 00:42:36,033
The river?

535
00:42:37,451 --> 00:42:38,452
The alcohol?

536
00:42:40,246 --> 00:42:41,247
Or me?

537
00:42:43,124 --> 00:42:44,959
[♪ hopeful music playing]
STYLE
::cue()

538
00:42:58,264 --> 00:42:59,557
[inhales sharply]

539
00:43:03,603 --> 00:43:04,604
[chuckles softly]

540
00:43:11,777 --> 00:43:12,778
[chuckles]

541
00:43:22,705 --> 00:43:23,706
[exhales sharply]

542
00:43:24,832 --> 00:43:25,833
[breathes deeply]

543
00:43:28,419 --> 00:43:29,420
[Hyeon mutters]

544
00:43:30,087 --> 00:43:33,007
-I like it all. I like the whole lot.
-[chuckles]

545
00:43:33,090 --> 00:43:35,092
[crickets chirping]

546
00:43:38,387 --> 00:43:39,555
[Huiju] Where are you?

547
00:43:40,139 --> 00:43:41,682
Did you have dinner?

548
00:43:41,766 --> 00:43:45,269
I get that you're angry and all,
but how could you just leave like this?

549
00:43:45,353 --> 00:43:46,187
[sighs]

550
00:43:46,270 --> 00:43:48,439
You're somewhere safe, right? [sighs]

551
00:43:48,522 --> 00:43:50,608
I swear, I will track your location.

552
00:43:52,235 --> 00:43:55,321
Is Aide Do even looking for him or what?

553
00:43:57,698 --> 00:43:58,699
Your Royal Highness.

554
00:44:00,284 --> 00:44:01,285
Yes?

555
00:44:02,370 --> 00:44:03,371
[chuckles]

556
00:44:04,580 --> 00:44:07,750
There was this one day
when His Royal Highness

557
00:44:09,168 --> 00:44:11,295
climbed over this wall.

558
00:44:14,674 --> 00:44:16,801
He seemed exceptionally happy that day.

559
00:44:17,593 --> 00:44:20,179
I wondered if he'd hidden
a sweet pot of honey here.

560
00:44:20,263 --> 00:44:22,181
It wasn't until the next day
that I found out

561
00:44:22,932 --> 00:44:24,475
that a maiden was responsible.

562
00:44:25,810 --> 00:44:26,978
[chuckles]

563
00:44:27,061 --> 00:44:28,187
[Lady Choi] And so,

564
00:44:28,771 --> 00:44:30,356
I have faith in the both of you.

565
00:44:31,357 --> 00:44:34,610
You are both desperate
to protect one another, are you not?

566
00:44:36,737 --> 00:44:38,030
[Lady Choi inhales deeply]

567
00:44:39,073 --> 00:44:40,700
The palace gates will be shut soon.

568
00:44:45,037 --> 00:44:46,038
[gasps]

569
00:44:47,123 --> 00:44:48,249
Then can I just…

570
00:44:48,332 --> 00:44:49,792
[♪ upbeat pop music playing]

571
00:44:49,875 --> 00:44:50,835
[breathes heavily]

572
00:44:50,918 --> 00:44:52,253
Oh.

573
00:44:52,336 --> 00:44:53,921
But what if someone asks for me?

574
00:44:54,005 --> 00:44:55,548
Do not worry.

575
00:44:59,176 --> 00:45:01,178
[♪ upbeat pop music continues]

576
00:45:20,990 --> 00:45:21,991
[pants]

577
00:45:45,639 --> 00:45:46,807
[Huiju] I'm sick.

578
00:45:46,891 --> 00:45:49,393
PRINCE

579
00:45:51,312 --> 00:45:52,313
[exhales deeply]

580
00:45:56,525 --> 00:45:57,526
[phone buzzes]

581
00:46:09,747 --> 00:46:11,165
[engine revving]

582
00:46:22,009 --> 00:46:23,302
[footsteps approaching]

583
00:46:24,428 --> 00:46:25,429
[panting]

584
00:46:27,014 --> 00:46:28,015
[♪ music ends]

585
00:46:28,099 --> 00:46:29,100
[pants]

586
00:46:33,312 --> 00:46:34,313
I thought you were sick.

587
00:46:35,231 --> 00:46:36,399
[breathes heavily]

588
00:46:37,066 --> 00:46:38,651
I just wanted to be with you.

589
00:46:43,572 --> 00:46:45,157
I told you I'd be back tomorrow.

590
00:46:45,783 --> 00:46:47,201
[breathing shakily]

591
00:46:47,284 --> 00:46:48,285
Are you okay?

592
00:46:56,419 --> 00:46:58,212
[breathing shakily]

593
00:47:02,716 --> 00:47:03,843
I like you.

594
00:47:07,304 --> 00:47:08,764
[♪ gentle music playing]

595
00:47:28,075 --> 00:47:29,076
Stick to one thing.

596
00:47:30,411 --> 00:47:31,537
I'm getting confused.

597
00:47:33,831 --> 00:47:35,082
No, you're not.

598
00:47:38,002 --> 00:47:39,044
You know I like you.
STYLE
::cue()

599
00:47:41,380 --> 00:47:43,674
And that I only asked
for a divorce to protect you.

600
00:47:46,552 --> 00:47:47,887
That's why you're mad.

601
00:47:58,939 --> 00:48:01,942
[♪ pop music playing, WOODZ "Everglow"]

602
00:48:24,131 --> 00:48:25,174
You don't want this?

603
00:48:35,142 --> 00:48:36,143
I do.

604
00:49:23,816 --> 00:49:24,942
[objects clatter]

605
00:49:26,277 --> 00:49:27,111
[I-AN chuckles]

606
00:49:35,786 --> 00:49:36,787
[kissing]

607
00:50:09,028 --> 00:50:10,070
[♪ song ends]

608
00:50:10,154 --> 00:50:12,156
[birds chirping]

609
00:50:20,205 --> 00:50:21,206
Your Royal Highness?

610
00:50:29,798 --> 00:50:30,799
You're awake.

611
00:50:32,301 --> 00:50:33,302
What's going on?

612
00:50:34,553 --> 00:50:35,846
[sighs]

613
00:50:35,929 --> 00:50:37,222
I got a call from the palace.

614
00:50:40,601 --> 00:50:41,602
What's wrong?

615
00:50:43,187 --> 00:50:44,396
Did you have a nightmare?

616
00:50:45,689 --> 00:50:46,690
[sighs]

617
00:50:48,525 --> 00:50:50,402
I was just a little scared.

618
00:50:56,492 --> 00:50:57,868
[I-AN sighs]

619
00:50:58,911 --> 00:51:00,454
Stay here for the time being.

620
00:51:02,122 --> 00:51:04,333
By myself? Why?

621
00:51:05,125 --> 00:51:06,835
The second edict will be delivered soon.

622
00:51:08,379 --> 00:51:09,380
And I will

623
00:51:10,297 --> 00:51:11,465
refuse it once more.

624
00:51:12,800 --> 00:51:13,801
Hold on a second.

625
00:51:15,594 --> 00:51:16,762
One step at a time.

626
00:51:16,845 --> 00:51:19,473
Walk me through step by step
so I can understand.

627
00:51:21,266 --> 00:51:22,559
With a royal abdication edict,

628
00:51:24,061 --> 00:51:25,688
it's customary to refuse three times.

629
00:51:27,147 --> 00:51:28,524
And then?

630
00:51:30,442 --> 00:51:31,485
I have to accept it.

631
00:51:34,113 --> 00:51:36,448
But you wanted to protect His Majesty.

632
00:51:41,537 --> 00:51:43,080
I wanted to protect my nephew.

633
00:51:45,416 --> 00:51:46,417
Not the king.

634
00:51:51,714 --> 00:51:53,841
-Whoosh.
-[chuckles]

635
00:51:53,924 --> 00:51:55,509
[I-AN] Whoosh.

636
00:51:55,592 --> 00:51:58,387
[Yun] You intend for Grand Prince I-AN
to ascend the throne?

637
00:51:59,596 --> 00:52:02,933
Have you truly gone mad?
[breathes shakily]

638
00:52:03,016 --> 00:52:05,269
[♪ tense music playing]

639
00:52:23,829 --> 00:52:24,830
[sighs]
STYLE
::cue()

640
00:52:33,922 --> 00:52:34,965
What is this?

641
00:52:35,883 --> 00:52:40,220
His Majesty had a garment made for you.

642
00:52:44,224 --> 00:52:46,727
[gasps, breathes shakily]

643
00:52:51,398 --> 00:52:53,400
[♪ tense music intensifies]

644
00:53:00,199 --> 00:53:01,200
[sighs]

645
00:53:04,495 --> 00:53:05,496
It appears my brother…

646
00:53:08,081 --> 00:53:09,541
seeks to abdicate.

647
00:53:10,083 --> 00:53:12,252
But what about the Crown Prince?

648
00:53:14,254 --> 00:53:15,506
[I-AN] I hated him for it.

649
00:53:16,924 --> 00:53:19,218
He turned a blind eye
when I longed for it so desperately.

650
00:53:20,427 --> 00:53:24,056
It felt like he was thrusting the burden
when it was far too late.

651
00:53:24,139 --> 00:53:25,307
[Hyeon] Your Royal Highness!

652
00:53:25,390 --> 00:53:26,975
[footsteps running]

653
00:53:28,185 --> 00:53:29,561
[panting]

654
00:53:31,522 --> 00:53:33,148
Something terrible has happened.

655
00:53:33,232 --> 00:53:34,483
[panting]

656
00:53:35,734 --> 00:53:36,735
[I-AN] But…

657
00:53:41,782 --> 00:53:42,950
I was the one too late.

658
00:53:44,910 --> 00:53:45,911
[♪ music ends]

659
00:53:49,706 --> 00:53:51,708
[♪ mournful music playing]

660
00:53:56,046 --> 00:53:59,383
[I-AN] So I wanted to protect my nephew,
no matter what.

661
00:54:00,843 --> 00:54:01,885
In my brother's place.

662
00:54:03,595 --> 00:54:05,138
Where is the Crown Prince?

663
00:54:05,681 --> 00:54:06,682
[guard] Pardon?

664
00:54:06,765 --> 00:54:08,392
Where is my nephew…

665
00:54:10,477 --> 00:54:11,854
the heir to the throne?

666
00:54:14,481 --> 00:54:16,483
[♪ mournful music continues]

667
00:54:17,609 --> 00:54:18,610
[I-AN] When the Queen Mother

668
00:54:20,362 --> 00:54:22,281
turned a blind eye
to my brother's dying wish…

669
00:54:28,412 --> 00:54:29,454
[breathes shakily]

670
00:54:29,538 --> 00:54:31,290
Even when my nephew told me he was scared…

671
00:54:35,544 --> 00:54:37,004
[breathing shakily]

672
00:54:38,088 --> 00:54:39,172
I hesitated.

673
00:54:49,558 --> 00:54:50,642
If I become king,

674
00:54:52,144 --> 00:54:53,812
I feel like I could protect everyone.

675
00:54:56,898 --> 00:54:57,899
But then again…

676
00:55:02,738 --> 00:55:04,114
I fear it's just my own greed.

677
00:55:16,168 --> 00:55:17,252
You can be greedy.

678
00:55:24,051 --> 00:55:25,052
Let's see this through.

679
00:55:27,929 --> 00:55:29,097
I will be by your side.

680
00:55:35,896 --> 00:55:37,898
[♪ mournful music intensifies]

681
00:55:46,865 --> 00:55:49,785
[protestor on megaphone]
Remove Grand Prince I-AN as regent!

682
00:55:49,868 --> 00:55:51,912
-Remove him!
-Remove him!

683
00:55:51,995 --> 00:55:54,956
[protestor]
Strip Seong Huiju of her rank immediately!

684
00:55:55,040 --> 00:55:57,042
-Immediately!
-Immediately!

685
00:55:57,125 --> 00:56:00,629
[protestor] Grand Prince I-AN and
CEO Seong Huiju must apologize!

686
00:56:00,712 --> 00:56:02,631
[protestors chanting]
Apologize! Apologize!

687
00:56:02,714 --> 00:56:03,715
Your Royal Highness.

688
00:56:03,799 --> 00:56:05,300
[protestors continue chanting
indistinctly]

689
00:56:05,384 --> 00:56:07,094
The Queen Mother is asking for you.

690
00:56:17,104 --> 00:56:18,105
All right.

691
00:56:30,367 --> 00:56:31,576
[sighs]

692
00:56:31,660 --> 00:56:32,661
[door closes]

693
00:56:45,841 --> 00:56:47,175
Tell them you cannot accept.

694
00:56:51,138 --> 00:56:52,139
[sighs]

695
00:56:53,223 --> 00:56:54,224
[scoffs]

696
00:56:55,058 --> 00:56:56,893
Surely you do not intend to accept.

697
00:56:59,354 --> 00:57:02,023
His Majesty has
only eight years of life to his name.

698
00:57:02,107 --> 00:57:04,317
He is incapable
of forming thoughts or intentions!

699
00:57:04,401 --> 00:57:05,527
That is it!

700
00:57:07,946 --> 00:57:09,573
That is exactly the issue.

701
00:57:11,283 --> 00:57:12,367
He has no will

702
00:57:13,034 --> 00:57:15,662
or mind of his own, yet you have him
sit up there as a puppet

703
00:57:15,746 --> 00:57:17,247
tossing him about as you please!
STYLE
::cue()

704
00:57:20,083 --> 00:57:21,501
That is precisely the issue.

705
00:57:23,670 --> 00:57:25,672
Is that what you told His Majesty?

706
00:57:27,424 --> 00:57:30,677
You are the one who made
the king into a puppet!

707
00:57:32,304 --> 00:57:33,305
Yes.

708
00:57:34,723 --> 00:57:35,891
I let that happen.

709
00:57:37,601 --> 00:57:40,187
Whether beside or behind him,
he was easily pushed around.

710
00:57:40,270 --> 00:57:42,564
[♪ contemplative music playing]

711
00:57:42,647 --> 00:57:43,690
So now…

712
00:57:46,026 --> 00:57:47,319
I must stand in front of him.

713
00:57:49,738 --> 00:57:51,114
I-AN!

714
00:57:51,198 --> 00:57:53,074
[breathing shakily]

715
00:57:55,327 --> 00:57:56,328
[sighs]

716
00:57:59,372 --> 00:58:00,373
Queen Mother.

717
00:58:02,542 --> 00:58:05,045
You should be thankful
he stepped down on his own.

718
00:58:06,713 --> 00:58:08,465
In consideration of his filial devotion,

719
00:58:10,008 --> 00:58:11,092
I will not ask you…

720
00:58:13,094 --> 00:58:14,221
to pay for your sins.

721
00:58:18,683 --> 00:58:19,684
Why?

722
00:58:22,604 --> 00:58:25,357
Why insist on becoming king only now?

723
00:58:27,317 --> 00:58:28,860
[Yun crying]

724
00:58:28,944 --> 00:58:30,946
[♪ contemplative piano music playing]

725
00:58:35,992 --> 00:58:37,494
I have made my sacrifices.

726
00:58:39,746 --> 00:58:41,456
So you must do the same.

727
00:58:43,208 --> 00:58:45,293
[crying] That is only fair!

728
00:58:48,213 --> 00:58:49,214
[sobbing]

729
00:59:02,394 --> 00:59:03,854
I gave up on my dreams.

730
00:59:10,402 --> 00:59:13,113
You must become the Crown Princess.

731
00:59:15,323 --> 00:59:16,658
[Yun] My future.

732
00:59:17,158 --> 00:59:19,035
[students chattering]

733
00:59:21,413 --> 00:59:22,581
[I-AN] Yun Irang!

734
00:59:24,040 --> 00:59:26,042
[♪ gentle music playing]

735
00:59:39,848 --> 00:59:41,057
[chuckles softly]

736
00:59:44,394 --> 00:59:46,438
[Yun crying] And even my heart.

737
00:59:48,857 --> 00:59:49,858
So why?

738
00:59:50,483 --> 00:59:51,985
[breathes shakily]

739
00:59:52,068 --> 00:59:54,696
Why won't you give anything up? [cries]

740
01:00:01,453 --> 01:00:03,121
[sobbing]

741
01:00:22,599 --> 01:00:23,892
[I-AN] Court Lady Im, are you there?

742
01:00:29,105 --> 01:00:30,440
[exhales shakily]

743
01:00:30,523 --> 01:00:32,442
Her Majesty appears weary
in mind and body.

744
01:00:33,818 --> 01:00:34,903
For the next three days,

745
01:00:36,529 --> 01:00:38,281
permit no one to enter her quarters.

746
01:00:39,074 --> 01:00:41,034
[Lady Im] Yes, Your Royal Highness.

747
01:00:41,117 --> 01:00:42,327
[breathes shakily]

748
01:00:54,506 --> 01:00:56,383
-[exhales sharply]
-[Lady Im] Your Majesty…

749
01:01:00,470 --> 01:01:01,513
[sobbing]

750
01:01:04,724 --> 01:01:05,809
[♪ music fades]

751
01:01:05,892 --> 01:01:07,769
[rain pattering]

752
01:01:07,852 --> 01:01:10,188
[Lord INPYEONG on phone]
What on earth are you doing?

753
01:01:10,772 --> 01:01:12,565
If His Majesty refused to open the doors,

754
01:01:12,649 --> 01:01:14,859
you should've torn them down!

755
01:01:16,736 --> 01:01:19,155
[sighs] Never mind.
I will head there now--

756
01:01:19,239 --> 01:01:20,657
[Yun] It will all be in vain.

757
01:01:22,033 --> 01:01:23,159
For the next three days,

758
01:01:24,869 --> 01:01:27,455
no one will be permitted
to enter my quarters.

759
01:01:28,081 --> 01:01:29,124
And why is that?

760
01:01:30,458 --> 01:01:32,293
If the Grand Prince accepts
the abdication,

761
01:01:32,377 --> 01:01:34,379
he will destroy us.

762
01:01:34,462 --> 01:01:35,463
[sighs]

763
01:01:39,050 --> 01:01:41,428
He has stated
he will not hold me accountable.

764
01:01:41,511 --> 01:01:42,554
[Lord INPYEONG] Do you really believe…

765
01:01:43,972 --> 01:01:45,557
[breathing heavily]

766
01:01:45,640 --> 01:01:49,352
Ignoring the late King's dying wish
isn't our only crime.

767
01:01:50,228 --> 01:01:52,439
Even if Prime Minister Min
is covering for us now,

768
01:01:52,522 --> 01:01:54,858
-if he becomes king--
-That is enough!

769
01:01:55,358 --> 01:01:58,653
Do you intend to surrender
all privileges held by the royal family?

770
01:01:58,737 --> 01:01:59,904
Father!

771
01:02:01,197 --> 01:02:03,033
I will take over from here.
STYLE
::cue()

772
01:02:06,536 --> 01:02:08,204
What are you plotting now?

773
01:02:08,288 --> 01:02:10,623
It will be too late after his ascension.

774
01:02:11,958 --> 01:02:13,585
What does that mean?

775
01:02:13,668 --> 01:02:15,170
[Lord INPYEONG] Your Majesty,

776
01:02:16,254 --> 01:02:18,006
you just need to protect your quarters.

777
01:02:18,089 --> 01:02:20,341
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

778
01:02:20,842 --> 01:02:21,843
Father?

779
01:02:22,719 --> 01:02:24,179
-[call ends]
-[gasps]

780
01:02:37,275 --> 01:02:39,736
[staff member]
Lord INPYEONG, you have a guest.

781
01:02:44,074 --> 01:02:47,077
[♪ suspenseful music intensifies]

782
01:03:22,695 --> 01:03:23,988
[♪ music fades]

783
01:03:24,072 --> 01:03:25,865
[rain pattering]

784
01:03:29,119 --> 01:03:30,620
[♪ gentle music playing]

785
01:03:30,703 --> 01:03:33,832
-Wow. Is this what he's wearing today?
-Yes.

786
01:03:34,332 --> 01:03:37,794
The last edict will be
personally delivered by His Majesty.

787
01:03:37,877 --> 01:03:42,423
[sucks teeth] But he didn't wear this
to His Majesty's Royal Birthday Banquet?

788
01:03:42,507 --> 01:03:43,925
[gasps] Thank you for bringing that up.

789
01:03:44,008 --> 01:03:46,219
-I went through hell that day--
-[clears throat]

790
01:03:47,345 --> 01:03:49,180
-[chuckles softly]
-[Lady Choi sobbing]

791
01:03:52,475 --> 01:03:53,476
Oh…

792
01:03:54,936 --> 01:03:56,896
His Majesty, the late King,

793
01:03:57,856 --> 01:03:59,524
would have been delighted to see this.

794
01:04:00,024 --> 01:04:01,442
[chuckles, sniffles]

795
01:04:01,943 --> 01:04:02,944
[chuckles softly]

796
01:04:04,946 --> 01:04:06,030
I'm delighted too.

797
01:04:07,866 --> 01:04:08,992
[chuckles]

798
01:04:09,993 --> 01:04:11,161
[Hyejeong] Your Royal Highness.

799
01:04:14,789 --> 01:04:16,082
The Royal Secretariat has notified

800
01:04:16,166 --> 01:04:18,126
the Office of Royal Relatives
and the Prime Minister.

801
01:04:18,209 --> 01:04:21,045
Goodness, they'll all be racing
to the palace now.

802
01:04:21,129 --> 01:04:22,213
[Hyejeong] Before that, we have

803
01:04:22,297 --> 01:04:24,799
some documents from the Secretariat
and Rites for your review.

804
01:04:25,550 --> 01:04:26,551
Are you ready to go?

805
01:04:28,428 --> 01:04:30,430
[♪ hopeful music playing]

806
01:04:37,604 --> 01:04:38,897
I'll be waiting here.

807
01:04:38,980 --> 01:04:39,981
[chuckles softly]

808
01:04:40,732 --> 01:04:41,733
Okay.

809
01:05:00,960 --> 01:05:02,295
[Lady Im] Your Majesty,

810
01:05:02,378 --> 01:05:04,214
His Majesty has arrived.

811
01:05:04,297 --> 01:05:05,632
[door opens]

812
01:05:12,889 --> 01:05:14,224
What brings you here?

813
01:05:16,017 --> 01:05:17,101
Mother.

814
01:05:17,185 --> 01:05:20,230
If you do not intend to rescind it,
you should turn back.

815
01:05:20,313 --> 01:05:21,731
I…

816
01:05:21,814 --> 01:05:23,650
Your father fought to protect that throne!

817
01:05:25,735 --> 01:05:26,778
[His Majesty cries]

818
01:05:28,238 --> 01:05:32,742
Do you have any idea
what he went through to safeguard it?

819
01:05:33,284 --> 01:05:36,246
Do you know what I had to do
to ensure it was passed down to you--

820
01:05:36,329 --> 01:05:37,997
I know!

821
01:05:39,040 --> 01:05:42,418
[sobbing] The day Father passed away…

822
01:05:44,045 --> 01:05:46,798
I heard everything.

823
01:05:48,925 --> 01:05:49,926
-[sobs]
-[gasps]

824
01:05:52,762 --> 01:05:55,556
[♪ mournful music playing]

825
01:05:57,642 --> 01:05:58,643
[gasps]

826
01:05:58,726 --> 01:06:00,311
[His Majesty crying]

827
01:06:02,647 --> 01:06:03,856
How…

828
01:06:03,940 --> 01:06:06,192
[His Majesty crying] I do not want to!

829
01:06:09,153 --> 01:06:10,196
[Yun] Crown Prince!

830
01:06:10,822 --> 01:06:13,825
I do not want to!

831
01:06:15,535 --> 01:06:16,703
[Yun sniffles]

832
01:06:16,786 --> 01:06:18,288
It was your father's dying wish.

833
01:06:20,540 --> 01:06:21,833
[crying]

834
01:06:23,084 --> 01:06:26,087
The only one I can rely on now
is you, Crown Prince…

835
01:06:28,756 --> 01:06:30,383
No. Your Majesty.

836
01:06:32,510 --> 01:06:33,845
[His Majesty crying]

837
01:06:33,928 --> 01:06:35,805
Do not disappoint me.

838
01:06:48,276 --> 01:06:50,278
[breathing shakily]
STYLE
::cue()

839
01:07:01,956 --> 01:07:03,624
Mother!

840
01:07:03,708 --> 01:07:05,126
[sobs]

841
01:07:09,005 --> 01:07:10,048
[sobs]

842
01:07:11,090 --> 01:07:14,677
Mother, please forgive me

843
01:07:15,511 --> 01:07:16,929
for disappointing you.

844
01:07:18,181 --> 01:07:19,557
[Yun breathes shakily]

845
01:07:21,434 --> 01:07:23,436
[His Majesty sobbing]

846
01:07:37,742 --> 01:07:39,744
[both crying]

847
01:07:45,208 --> 01:07:47,210
[♪ mournful music continues]

848
01:07:54,759 --> 01:07:56,761
[both sobbing]

849
01:08:00,181 --> 01:08:02,183
[♪ music fades]

850
01:08:03,518 --> 01:08:04,519
Sir.

851
01:08:05,186 --> 01:08:07,021
It's time to head to the Council Hall now.

852
01:08:08,481 --> 01:08:10,024
There's still plenty of time.

853
01:08:12,110 --> 01:08:13,111
[secretary] Yes, sir.

854
01:08:16,739 --> 01:08:18,199
[sighs]

855
01:08:18,282 --> 01:08:20,284
[♪ contemplative music playing]

856
01:08:23,246 --> 01:08:25,248
[birds chirping]

857
01:08:36,551 --> 01:08:38,886
I will take over from here.

858
01:08:39,929 --> 01:08:40,930
[sighs]

859
01:08:42,140 --> 01:08:45,059
[Jeongwoo] You must stop either
the Grand Prince or His Majesty.

860
01:08:45,143 --> 01:08:46,477
Do whatever you must.

861
01:08:49,480 --> 01:08:50,606
[I-AN] I will not ask you

862
01:08:52,567 --> 01:08:53,693
to pay for your sins.

863
01:08:54,527 --> 01:08:55,528
[sighs]

864
01:09:03,035 --> 01:09:04,537
I-AN

865
01:09:06,664 --> 01:09:07,915
[line ringing]

866
01:09:09,250 --> 01:09:10,626
[phone buzzes]

867
01:09:10,710 --> 01:09:12,962
Your Royal Highness,
it is the Queen Mother.

868
01:09:14,172 --> 01:09:15,339
[continues buzzing]

869
01:09:20,344 --> 01:09:22,722
[Jeongwoo] I'd like a brief audience
in the Council Hall.

870
01:09:23,306 --> 01:09:25,558
Do we have time
before we're due at the Throne Hall?

871
01:09:26,142 --> 01:09:27,018
Well…

872
01:09:28,060 --> 01:09:30,480
Yes, we have about 30 minutes.

873
01:09:31,230 --> 01:09:32,231
Right.

874
01:09:38,863 --> 01:09:39,864
[sighs]

875
01:09:45,912 --> 01:09:48,289
[♪ tense music playing]

876
01:09:48,372 --> 01:09:49,624
Court Lady Im.

877
01:09:55,922 --> 01:09:57,298
Yes, Your Majesty.

878
01:10:01,093 --> 01:10:02,428
I need the girl I hid…

879
01:10:06,724 --> 01:10:08,184
brought to the palace.

880
01:10:11,979 --> 01:10:14,065
PROTOCOL FOR THE ACCESSION
OF THE 34TH KING

881
01:10:14,148 --> 01:10:15,149
[sighing]

882
01:10:16,400 --> 01:10:17,944
[sucks teeth] Be honest with me.

883
01:10:18,611 --> 01:10:19,654
About what?

884
01:10:20,530 --> 01:10:21,656
If I become…

885
01:10:22,782 --> 01:10:24,575
If I become the Queen,

886
01:10:25,827 --> 01:10:27,620
people wouldn't like it, right?

887
01:10:28,913 --> 01:10:31,249
Come on now. Your Royal Highness?
Who would ever?

888
01:10:31,332 --> 01:10:33,668
My goodness. Who would dare?

889
01:10:33,751 --> 01:10:34,752
If I ever find them…

890
01:10:34,836 --> 01:10:37,088
Hyejeong would've been
brutally honest with me.

891
01:10:38,256 --> 01:10:40,258
Yes. Well, they won't be too thrilled.

892
01:10:40,341 --> 01:10:41,592
-[chuckles]
-[groans]

893
01:10:42,927 --> 01:10:44,637
Right, exactly!

894
01:10:44,720 --> 01:10:47,390
If I had known about this,
I wouldn't have stepped up.

895
01:10:47,473 --> 01:10:49,225
I was planning
to just take the fall for it

896
01:10:49,308 --> 01:10:51,853
and bounce out of here
without looking back.

897
01:10:51,936 --> 01:10:53,312
No need to get worked up.

898
01:10:53,855 --> 01:10:58,651
Not everyone is a fan
of the Grand Prince, either. [chuckles]

899
01:10:59,735 --> 01:11:01,195
I only have haters.

900
01:11:01,279 --> 01:11:02,989
Oh, I see.

901
01:11:04,907 --> 01:11:05,908
You can do it!

902
01:11:06,701 --> 01:11:07,910
[phone buzzes]

903
01:11:07,994 --> 01:11:10,204
PAIN IN MY ASS

904
01:11:10,288 --> 01:11:11,831
[line ringing]

905
01:11:14,083 --> 01:11:15,084
[Huiju] Yes?

906
01:11:15,167 --> 01:11:19,714
Hey, you said you'd call.
I've been waiting forever, you know.

907
01:11:19,797 --> 01:11:22,216
Should I move to the next step?
Father in the hospital?

908
01:11:22,300 --> 01:11:24,760
No. Don't. Just stop that for now.

909
01:11:24,844 --> 01:11:27,722
Stop? Why? Are they
calling off the company audit?

910
01:11:28,931 --> 01:11:30,433
No, that's not it.

911
01:11:32,018 --> 01:11:34,145
[sighs] Where are you now? Father's place?

912
01:11:34,228 --> 01:11:36,647
-Yeah.
-[Huiju] Stay there. I'll be right over.

913
01:11:36,731 --> 01:11:38,274
-At least tell me what's going…
-[call ends]

914
01:11:38,357 --> 01:11:39,525
Damn brat.

915
01:11:40,484 --> 01:11:42,278
Why? What did Huiju say?

916
01:11:42,862 --> 01:11:44,780
-She's coming here.
-What?
STYLE
::cue()

917
01:11:46,532 --> 01:11:47,533
[sucks teeth]

918
01:12:04,133 --> 01:12:06,135
[♪ tense music playing]

919
01:12:12,892 --> 01:12:14,352
[explosion in distance]

920
01:12:15,937 --> 01:12:17,939
[♪ dramatic music playing]

921
01:12:18,731 --> 01:12:19,732
Grand Princess.

922
01:12:20,358 --> 01:12:21,359
You must flee.

923
01:12:21,442 --> 01:12:22,610
[gasps]

924
01:12:22,693 --> 01:12:25,529
Isn't that… the Council Hall?

925
01:12:29,033 --> 01:12:29,909
[explosion]

926
01:12:32,995 --> 01:12:33,996
[breathes shakily]

927
01:12:45,591 --> 01:12:46,676
No…

928
01:12:47,218 --> 01:12:48,678
[breathes shakily] No!

929
01:12:49,887 --> 01:12:50,888
Your Highness!

930
01:12:52,640 --> 01:12:54,976
[clamoring]

931
01:13:03,526 --> 01:13:05,069
[panting, exclaims]

932
01:13:05,152 --> 01:13:07,279
[breathing heavily]

933
01:13:11,617 --> 01:13:12,618
Aide Do.

934
01:13:13,119 --> 01:13:14,120
What…

935
01:13:17,081 --> 01:13:18,290
What are you doing here?

936
01:13:19,625 --> 01:13:21,085
[breathes shakily]

937
01:13:24,005 --> 01:13:25,006
Tell me.

938
01:13:25,089 --> 01:13:26,590
[breathing shakily, whimpers]

939
01:13:28,342 --> 01:13:29,510
Do Hyejeong!

940
01:13:30,052 --> 01:13:31,053
The Council Hall…

941
01:13:34,056 --> 01:13:35,141
His Royal Highness.

942
01:13:36,183 --> 01:13:37,518
He's in the Council Hall.

943
01:13:37,601 --> 01:13:39,270
[breathing shakily]

944
01:13:42,398 --> 01:13:44,442
[♪ dramatic music intensifies]

945
01:13:51,198 --> 01:13:52,199
Your Royal Highness.

946
01:13:54,785 --> 01:13:55,953
[breathes shakily]

947
01:13:57,913 --> 01:13:58,914
Your Royal Highness.

948
01:14:03,753 --> 01:14:04,754
[♪ music fades]

949
01:14:06,714 --> 01:14:09,633
PERFECT CROWN

950
01:14:09,717 --> 01:14:12,511
[| contemplative music playing,
Byeon Wooseok, "Parallel"]

951
01:14:46,212 --> 01:14:47,797
[Hyejeong] His Royal Highness.

952
01:14:47,880 --> 01:14:49,090
He's in the Council Hall.

953
01:14:49,173 --> 01:14:50,591
[Huiju] Your Royal Highness!

954
01:14:50,674 --> 01:14:52,718
Your Royal Highness! [exclaims]

955
01:14:52,802 --> 01:14:55,763
[secretary] There's a rumor circulating
that the Grand Prince has passed away.

956
01:14:55,846 --> 01:14:56,972
What do you mean, regency?

957
01:14:57,056 --> 01:14:59,391
[Jeongwoo] Since the Grand Prince
remains unconscious,

958
01:14:59,475 --> 01:15:02,061
it would only be fitting
for Your Majesty to step forward.

959
01:15:02,144 --> 01:15:03,521
[Hyejeong] The Grand Prince is awake!

960
01:15:06,899 --> 01:15:09,568
[I-AN] I hear rumors of my passing
are spreading outside these walls.

961
01:15:09,652 --> 01:15:12,571
[Huiju] How could one measly royal guard
blow up the Council Hall by himself?

962
01:15:12,655 --> 01:15:14,406
Since the Grand Prince
has regained consciousness,

963
01:15:14,490 --> 01:15:16,367
it's time we tied up some loose ends.

964
01:15:16,909 --> 01:15:19,453
[Huiju] How much do you trust Jeongwoo?

965
01:15:20,371 --> 01:15:23,082
Is there any place safe for you?

966
01:15:25,960 --> 01:15:27,920
Translated by Justin S. Kim

967
01:15:28,003 --> 01:15:29,964
[♪ pop music playing]

968
01:15:39,223 --> 01:15:42,935
PERFECT CROWN

